@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Abrir Aulas / Listar (CLI HTTP)

actor "Administrador" as Admin
participant "CLI (Click)" as CLI
participant "APIClient" as Client
participant "TokenManager" as Token
participant "API (FastAPI)" as API
participant "AulaService" as Service
participant "AulaRepository" as Repo
database "Base de Datos" as DB
participant "OutputFormatter" as Formatter

Admin -> CLI: Ejecuta 'sighor aulas list'
activate CLI
CLI -> Token: get_token()
activate Token
Token --> CLI: access_token
deactivate Token
CLI -> Client: get('/aulas', headers={'Authorization': 'Bearer {token}'})
activate Client
Client -> API: GET /aulas (Header: Bearer Token)
activate API
API -> Service: listar_aulas()
activate Service
Service -> Repo: get_all()
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM aulas
activate DB
DB --> Repo: List[Aula]
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: List[Aula]
deactivate Repo
Service --> API: List[AulaResponse]
deactivate Service
API --> Client: 200 OK (JSON List)
deactivate API
Client --> CLI: Response(200, aulas_json)
deactivate Client
CLI -> Formatter: format_table(aulas)
activate Formatter
Formatter --> CLI: Tabla ASCII (Rich)
deactivate Formatter
CLI --> Admin: Mostrar tabla de aulas
deactivate CLI

note right of API
  **Backend FastAPI reutilizado:**
  - AulaService
  - AulaRepository
  - Base de datos SQLite
  Sin modificaciones
end note

@enduml
